#: ../../config/options_local_files.rst:6
msgid ":index:`Local Files <configuration; local files>`"
msgstr ":index:`本地文件 <configuration; local files>`"

#: ../../config/options_local_files.rst:8
msgid "In this section you can configure the file names to be used by the Local Files cover art provider. If you are trying to collect more than one image, the naming is important."
msgstr ""
"在此部分中，您可以配置本地文件封面艺术提供程序要使用的文件名。如果您试图收集"
"多个图像，命名非常重要。"

#: ../../config/options_local_files.rst:21
msgid "The file names are defined using a `regular expression <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Regular_expression>`_. The default is ``^(?:cover|folder|albumart)(.*)\\.(?:jpe?g|png|gif|tiff?)$`` which will load files with the name \"cover\", \"folder\" or \"albumart\" and the file extension \"jpg\", \"png\", \"gif\" or \"tiff\" (e.g.: \"folder.jpg\" or \"cover.png\")."
msgstr ""
"文件名使用 `正则表达式 <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Regular_expression>`_ "
"定义。默认值为 ``^(?:cover|folder|albumart)(.*)\\.(?:jpe?g|png|gif|tiff?)"
"$``，它将加载名称为 \"cover\"、\"folder\" 或 \"albumart\" 且文件扩展名为 "
"\"jpg\"、\"png\"、\"gif\" 或 \"tiff\" 的文件（例如：\"folder.jpg\" 或 "
"\"cover.png\"）。"

#: ../../config/options_local_files.rst:23
msgid "The first part of the regular expression is a non-capture group: ``(?:cover|folder|albumart)``. Items listed in this group will not get captured and the default (Front) type will apply."
msgstr ""
"正则表达式的第一部分是一个非捕获组：``(?:cover|folder|albumart)``。此组中列出"
"的项目不会被捕获，并将应用默认（前）类型。"

#: ../../config/options_local_files.rst:25
msgid "The second part of the regular expression is a group: ``(.*)``. This is the real capture, so if the file names match any of the cover art types, they will be tagged as such."
msgstr ""
"正则表达式的第二部分是一个组：``(.*)``。这是真正的捕获，因此如果文件名与任何"
"封面艺术类型匹配，它们将被标记为该类型。"

#: ../../config/options_local_files.rst:29
msgid "A common mistake is to add all the types into the first (non-capture) group. This means that all the regular file names would be thrown into the Front type and cause unexpected results."
msgstr ""
"一个常见的错误是将所有类型都添加到第一个（非捕获）组中。这意味着所有常规文件"
"名都会被抛入 Front 类型，并导致意外结果。"

#: ../../config/options_local_files.rst:31
msgid "**Test file name matching:**"
msgstr "**测试文件名匹配：**"

#: ../../config/options_local_files.rst:33
msgid "This area allows you to enter file names, one per line, to test your regular expression. If a file name is marked in red, it will not be included. A file name marked green matches your regular expression and will be included."
msgstr ""
"此区域允许您输入文件名，每行一个，以测试您的正则表达式。如果文件名标为红色，"
"则不会被包含。标为绿色的文件名与您的正则表达式匹配，将被包含。"

#: ../../config/options_local_files.rst:37
msgid "This list of test file names will be cleared when you exit the configuration section."
msgstr "当您退出配置部分时，此测试文件名列表将被清除。"
